</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 221); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Arial,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">'사회적</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 221); font-family: Arial,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"> 거리두기 실천</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 221); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Arial,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">'</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">과 함께 관람 부탁드립니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Arial,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><div style=\"background: url(&quot;/_common/_plugin/daumeditor/images/deco/contents/horizontalrule/line03.gif?v=2&quot;) repeat-x left; width: 99%; height: 15px;\"><hr style=\"border: 0px black; border-image: none; left: -9999px; top: -9999px; position: relative;\"></div><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Arial,sans-serif;\">&gt;&gt; 더불어,&nbsp;전시현장을 찾기 어려운 분들을 위해 영상 콘텐츠로 &nbsp;<strong><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 221);\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 221);\">차재영 (온라인)초대전&gt;</span></strong></strong>을&nbsp;</span><font face=\"Arial\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 85, 255);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 53, 53);\"><font color=\"#333333\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 85, 255);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 53, 53);\"><font color=\"#333333\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,sans-serif;\">공개합니다. </span></font></span></span></font></span></span></font></p><p style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 1.5;\"></p><font face=\"Arial\"><font color=\"#333333\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 85, 255);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 53, 53);\"><font color=\"#333333\"><p style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 85, 255);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 53, 53);\"><font color=\"#333333\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 85, 255);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 53, 53);\"><font color=\"#333333\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,sans-serif;\"><br></span></span></font></span></span></span></font></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 85, 255);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 53, 53);\"><font color=\"#333333\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 85, 255);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 53, 53);\"><font color=\"#333333\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,sans-serif;\">**내용 : 작가 및 전시 작품 소개, 갤러리 전시 풍경 등 (러닝타임 : 4</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial,sans-serif;\">분 26초)</span></span></font></span></span></span></font></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 85, 255);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 53, 53);\"><font color=\"#333333\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,sans-serif;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: Courier New,monspace;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Courier New,monspace; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 85, 255);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 53, 53);\"><font color=\"#333333\"><span style=\"font-family: Courier New,monspace; font-size: 11pt;\">(영상촬영 및 편집 : 금오공대교육방송국(KOBS))</span></font></span></span></span></font></span></span></p></font></span></span><p><br></p></font></font><p style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,sans-serif;\">**&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial,sans-serif;\">관람 방법 : 금오공대 강의지원시스템 - &lt;공개강의(OCW)&gt; - &lt;금오공대(온라인)갤러리&gt; - &lt;10월&nbsp;차재영 (온라인)초대전&gt;&nbsp;을 통해 관람 가능</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 1.5;\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-font-width: 98%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양중고딕;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <span style=\"font-family: Courier New,monspace;\">※ </span></span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: Courier New,monspace; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-font-width: 98%;\">학생</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: Courier New,monspace; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-font-width: 98%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양중고딕;\">, </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: Courier New,monspace; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-font-width: 98%;\">교직원은 원스톱 아이디</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-font-width: 98%;\"><span style=\"font-family: Courier New,monspace;\">로 로그인 가능 / 지역민은 SNS(네이버, 카카오톡) 아이디로&nbsp;간편 가입 후, 로그인 가능합니다. </span></span></font></p><p style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 1.5;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 221);\"><a class=\"tx-link\" href=\"http://ocw.kumoh.ac.kr/Main.do?cmd=viewHome\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif;\"><u><font color=\"#0066cc\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></font></u></span></a></span><a class=\"tx-link\" href=\"http://ocw.kumoh.ac.kr/Main.do?cmd=viewHome\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 221);\"><u><span style=\"font-family: Arial,sans-serif;\">☞ 금오공대 강의지원시스템 - &lt;공개강의&gt; 바로가기 (클릭!)</span></u></span></a></p><p><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt